@startuml L-本地配送
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · L 本地配送（UC-SUB-L-01 ~ L-08）
' L 组为 IA v1.5/v1.6 新增功能点（L-01~L-06 于 2026-09-08，L-07/L-08 于 2026-09-11 走规格书 §10 变更登记）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · L 本地配送
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "消费者" as CONSUMER
actor "商户" as MERCHANT
actor "骑手/配送员" as RIDER
actor "平台运营方" as OPS

rectangle "L 本地配送" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-L-01 选点下单并校验配送范围" as L01
  usecase "UC-SUB-L-02 跟踪订单状态与全程进度" as L02
  usecase "UC-SUB-L-03 接单备货并上报出餐" as L03
  usecase "UC-SUB-L-04 调度派单并处置异常" as L04
  usecase "UC-SUB-L-05 核验建档并管理骑手运力" as L05
  usecase "UC-SUB-L-06 存证位置轨迹并预警异常" as L06
  usecase "UC-SUB-L-07 兼容车型并承运大件货物" as L07
  usecase "UC-SUB-L-08 导航配送并共享实时位置" as L08
}

CONSUMER --> L01
CONSUMER --> L02
MERCHANT --> L03
OPS --> L04
OPS --> L05
RIDER --> L05
RIDER --> L06
RIDER --> L07
RIDER --> L08
CONSUMER --> L08
OPS --> L06
OPS --> L07

L02 ..> L08 : <<include>>
L07 ..> L01 : <<extend>>
L07 ..> L04 : <<include>>

note bottom of L07
  车辆类型 E_BIKE 电动车 / CAR 汽车；
  大件货（货件规格）要求 CAR，派单/接单按车型匹配
end note
note bottom of L08
  骑手端「导航到商铺 / 导航到配送地点」双导航
  按车型唤起地图开放平台（骑行/驾车）；
  位置心跳 → 买家配送中可见、送达即切断（R-03）
end note
@enduml
